  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b59e5109641be024fb790db23ec12cf0, type: 3}
  m_Name: Oliver_Q2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: Que faisiez-vous au moment des faits ?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Je suis arriv\xE9 \xE0 la soir\xE9e vers 19h00 pour y interviewer Monsieur
      Warner au sujet de son pass\xE9."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c1ea30fb2f07ec84382ca382ddb38ca8, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Mais ce dernier m\u2019a pr\xE9cis\xE9 avoir d\xE9j\xE0 organis\xE9 une
      interview avec Madame Brown malheureusement \u2026"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4c5043fd174becf4295a439bc899bd7f, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Alors j\u2019ai pass\xE9 ma soir\xE9e \xE0 discuter avec les invit\xE9s
      dans le but de trouver un nouveau scoop."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 772b40428ba65d143bf3d00500b6573e, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Pourtant, l\u2019une des servantes vous a vu \xE0 la porte de Monsieur.\_"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: ....
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb78998e8e801c943a05166514b4b2f8, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Hum, je voulais surveiller madame Brown durant la soir\xE9e. Donc lorsque
      je l\u2019ai vu sortir de la salle principale, je l\u2019ai suivi."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f7dea1d319d6cb4583762e0d0da2cc2, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Oui j\u2019ai \xE9cout\xE9 \xE0 la porte pour essayer de r\xE9cup\xE9rer
      les informations pour publier avant elle. Cependant, une servante arrivait
      dans le couloir et j\u2019ai d\xFB partir tr\xE8s vite."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f7dea1d319d6cb4583762e0d0da2cc2, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8c03d2174d8f80c4a9ee6c7040d7442d, type: 2}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  background: {fileID: 0}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2c719513821ff6946b5c8eede532181d, type: 2}
